<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor rates were mixed at the</p>
<p>Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday. The three-month</p>
<p>Helibor rate was steady at 3.09 percent.</p>
<p>					    Jan 7 fix	    Jan 3 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			   3.02 pct	    3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			   3.05 pct	    3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			   3.09 pct	    3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			   3.20 pct	    3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			   3.31 pct	    3.30 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			  3.43 pct	    3.42 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
